      "uid": "zhcn:a9b262edc50c2830dc359cfe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（这样的话，大家记忆中的\n“真弓快车”又是什么模样呢？）",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2e373c071c8a7c191432c4a4e13fb7c61f9a86d48106d5be730db4e43b982c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
