    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19e1e00dfc88c87b5c4cbb83",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "答案在遥远的未来",
      "source_fingerprint": "8885eb66dddcb1ebf5d4ca90fba21b6a2e94c512cbf7a3ac8cac578c8056452c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1087/storytimeline_041087007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f42eba258eeab28668e0d45",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是从早上开始就天气阴沉，稍微令人沉闷的一天，\n命运的邂逅悄然到来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec9caf3054152d3b1fd7522f5cf58f8506cf9c224321e6f4548fcbb02a0e2f09",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1088/storytimeline_041088001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cf821b1e3d2b7b4a875819e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "长时间伏案工作，为了缓解浑身的酸痛，\n雨停后去外面溜达溜达……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d7af485a511f1225426ff1c8c833e3be631b72da326621099ffe891a32dc91e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1088/storytimeline_041088001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff8956c7a9e6cdbb248140ff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她自信地说着，眼睛里闪烁着光芒。\n真心相信着自己……这是她给我留下的深刻印象。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1158714bd31f4643deba038bce278a43d6cd7f50ae9654c93f169216940485b1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1088/storytimeline_041088001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77b658e7c04033da48125f64",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e34abed1ddb126fde54bfedaf035b92aac16d1e143243cc656102c6ded090c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1088/storytimeline_041088001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
