      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:286c3f908549dd3f1ee91b67",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "直觉告诉我，『就是她』。我想和她搭档。\n雨过天晴。心生雀跃。没错，这就是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "36b511b1c81b4c114362f6d5599a17453210026387ce3172838b2355994f07b1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1088/storytimeline_041088001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40ad1ff62a17a6ecbe1359bf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "几天后，用为数不多的线索调查她的信息，\n得知她会参加今天的模拟比赛，按耐不住喜悦的我去了现场观看……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbabc7d9cf39c2e00a918ec6b90def8f3ab6cd2e3b164c98d083635799d2abbd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
