    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:742f9e560bea204204e13be6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『里见家的夙愿』……这个传闻在比赛界非常有名。\n里见家虽是新兴的家族，但已经为比赛界做出了巨大贡献。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f1947b6d3edf29a78aa91a68a6bd4d4a1ddcfe4125609c83783078d8f36e77f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
