        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3e9c355ec7806659ab52fee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "实际上，里见家还没有完成一项最大的成就，\n就是『家族中GⅠ赛马娘辈出』……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2143d7e785b3ee6f962a9a841357d78531ca78ca237814d69a7be9f1265c5a3e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1088/storytimeline_041088001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:708e53393f75a909c3075e8a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此，让家族中出现赢下GⅠ的名赛马娘，\n成为了里见家长年来的夙愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f3c91ba688ac0bab340d30dbc789696624eff558dc2b27edc09d8ade3078c20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
