      "uid": "zhcn:97c0479b9195ccdc16c20ae7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在队伍中间的里见皇冠从容不迫地观察周围。\n随后微微一笑，抓住最完美的时机开始发力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfc66e457061157261a1200ed56465d076ecc77678fdd35e49cfc7aec3195ddb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
